(6099314, 898400, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks straight out of a sci-fi story book. I like it a lot. :)</td>', 'Looks straight out of a sci-fi story book. I like it a lot. :)', '2010-07-21 08:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
