(6099319, 898489, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is the behinds the scenes at the side show.  It has a vintage feel like it''s the real thing.</td>', 'This is the behinds the scenes at the side show.  It has a vintage feel like it''s the real thing.', '2010-07-21 08:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099321, 898151, 15711, '<td valign="top">I had to look her up and found a different spelling for a Disney fairy and one character in the Kingdom of the Winds spelled the same.  Nevertheless, she''s lovely.</td>', 'I had to look her up and found a different spelling for a Disney fairy and one character in the Kingdom of the Winds spelled the same.  Nevertheless, she''s lovely.', '2010-07-21 08:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099322, 898581, 71239, '<td valign="top">Impressive amount of work to assemble this collection.  I like the choice of the dusty shelves as it gives a slightly darker mood to the overall image - much more "Brothers Grimm" than "Disney".</td>', 'Impressive amount of work to assemble this collection.  I like the choice of the dusty shelves as it gives a slightly darker mood to the overall image - much more "Brothers Grimm" than "Disney".', '2010-07-21 08:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099323, 898612, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is a great image.  Love the crispness of it all.  Straight off of the cover of a sci-fi novel.</td>', 'Oh this is a great image.  Love the crispness of it all.  Straight off of the cover of a sci-fi novel.', '2010-07-21 08:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099324, 898614, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous!!! A fantasy book cover for sure.</td>', 'This is fabulous!!! A fantasy book cover for sure.', '2010-07-21 09:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099325, 898428, 15711, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.  I love how you did her eyes.  Certainly a mythical creature indeed.</td>', 'Fabulous.  I love how you did her eyes.  Certainly a mythical creature indeed.', '2010-07-21 09:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099326, 898226, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very Middle Ages feel to it. I can see this as an illustration of Medieval beliefs.</td>', 'Very Middle Ages feel to it. I can see this as an illustration of Medieval beliefs.', '2010-07-21 09:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099327, 898681, 71239, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this shot.  I assume the feathers were on a much smaller scale than the horse, but by choosing an angle that brings the feathers up close it works very well.  As a bonus the angle removes the need to do any awkward blending of wing to torso and allows the viewers imagination to do the work.  Clever stuff!</td>', 'I really like the composition of this shot.  I assume the feathers were on a much smaller scale than the horse, but by choosing an angle that brings the feathers up close it works very well.  As a bonus the angle removes the need to do any awkward blending of wing to torso and allows the viewers imagination to do the work.  Clever stuff!', '2010-07-21 09:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099328, 898679, 49954, '<td valign="top">Angels are not mythical... and this is an interesting shot, but doesn''t convey angel very well either...  DNMC</td>', 'Angels are not mythical... and this is an interesting shot, but doesn''t convey angel very well either...  DNMC', '2010-07-21 09:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099329, 898686, 49954, '<td valign="top">Your extra long title is screwing up the voting page...  For that and the obvious brown attemp, I give you a 10.</td>', 'Your extra long title is screwing up the voting page...  For that and the obvious brown attemp, I give you a 10.', '2010-07-21 09:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099330, 898504, 49954, '<td valign="top">What mythical creature is this?  Three-eye man?  Not getting it.</td>', 'What mythical creature is this?  Three-eye man?  Not getting it.', '2010-07-21 09:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099331, 898504, 71239, '<td valign="top">Just the right model for the shot and the clothes and chain are spot on.  I''m guessing you co-opted an ID card/works pass for the chain due to the look of the clasp - nice touch!</td>', 'Just the right model for the shot and the clothes and chain are spot on.  I''m guessing you co-opted an ID card/works pass for the chain due to the look of the clasp - nice touch!', '2010-07-21 09:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099332, 898242, 49954, '<td valign="top">DNMC.  Photo of a statue.  Angels are not mythical.</td>', 'DNMC.  Photo of a statue.  Angels are not mythical.', '2010-07-21 09:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099333, 898273, 71239, '<td valign="top">Really like to dark mood to the shot - great expression on the model''s face too.</td>', 'Really like to dark mood to the shot - great expression on the model''s face too.', '2010-07-21 09:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099334, 897941, 49954, '<td valign="top">Not voting for obvious reasons, but for the record I feel this is a well edited shot and will get the blue if Medusa doesn''t steal it.<br/> <br/>That said:<br/> <br/>1.  It clearly DNMC because Satan is real and not mythological.<br/>2.  If this were a religion theme, it would not be an accurate representation because Satan is the most beautiful angel created.  He''s not the horns and hideousness so many have come to think.<br/> <br/>However, given #2, perhaps this DOES meet the challenge because it is a fictional or mythological characterization of Satan -- one that has no bearing on the real creature.<br/> <br/>Great editing though.  Hope it doesn''t make the front page so I''m not haunted for a week :)</td>', 'Not voting for obvious reasons, but for the record I feel this is a well edited shot and will get the blue if Medusa doesn''t steal it. That said: 1.  It clearly DNMC because Satan is real and not mythological.2.  If this were a religion theme, it would not be an accurate representation because Satan is the most beautiful angel created.  He''s not the horns and hideousness so many have come to think. However, given #2, perhaps this DOES meet the challenge because it is a fictional or mythological characterization of Satan -- one that has no bearing on the real creature. Great editing though.  Hope it doesn''t make the front page so I''m not haunted for a week :)', '2010-07-21 09:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099336, 898612, 49954, '<td valign="top">Not sure where hope comes from, but a great edit.  Ribbon territory...</td>', 'Not sure where hope comes from, but a great edit.  Ribbon territory...', '2010-07-21 09:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099348, 898576, 71239, '<td valign="top">Basic composition is fine, but it would benefit from the addition of a shadow underneath - without it the centauress seems detached from the ground she is standing on.  Bonus brownie point for the correct archery position :-)</td>', 'Basic composition is fine, but it would benefit from the addition of a shadow underneath - without it the centauress seems detached from the ground she is standing on.  Bonus brownie point for the correct archery position :-)', '2010-07-21 09:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099350, 898539, 71239, '<td valign="top">Fantastic expressions on the faces - great capture.</td>', 'Fantastic expressions on the faces - great capture.', '2010-07-21 09:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099351, 898400, 71239, '<td valign="top">Great image, great compositing.  Lighting spot on for the individual elements and I''d love to know what the source of the the fire jet was.<br/> <br/>Top notch - must ribbon.</td>', 'Great image, great compositing.  Lighting spot on for the individual elements and I''d love to know what the source of the the fire jet was. Top notch - must ribbon.', '2010-07-21 09:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099353, 898614, 71239, '<td valign="top">Great merging of the individual elements - is that the creative use of a tree trunk for the neck !?!</td>', 'Great merging of the individual elements - is that the creative use of a tree trunk for the neck !?!', '2010-07-21 09:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
