(6099659, 898489, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is bizarre if only because a centaur is a human torso on a horse''s body. In classical mythology, the closest to what you have here would be the minotaur, a bull''s head on a human body. In the Hindu pantheon, Hayagriva, an avatar of vishnu, is the God of wisdom and knowledge, and has a horse''s head on a human body.<br/> <br/>But what am I to make of this? I''m assuming you wanted me to wonder, that this is allegorical...</td>', 'This is bizarre if only because a centaur is a human torso on a horse''s body. In classical mythology, the closest to what you have here would be the minotaur, a bull''s head on a human body. In the Hindu pantheon, Hayagriva, an avatar of vishnu, is the God of wisdom and knowledge, and has a horse''s head on a human body. But what am I to make of this? I''m assuming you wanted me to wonder, that this is allegorical...', '2010-07-21 13:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
