(6099746, 898400, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh, classic.  This is a professional job.  Lighting direction has been carefully maintained, as has the tonal changes throughout the image.  Front page.</td>', 'Oh, classic.  This is a professional job.  Lighting direction has been carefully maintained, as has the tonal changes throughout the image.  Front page.', '2010-07-21 14:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099748, 898111, 96751, '<td valign="top">VERY nicely done.  Love the background tones, and the image on it adds to the overall appeal of this capture.  Could also have worked in the dof challenge :-)</td>', 'VERY nicely done.  Love the background tones, and the image on it adds to the overall appeal of this capture.  Could also have worked in the dof challenge :-)', '2010-07-21 14:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099754, 898592, 96751, '<td valign="top">Overall, this image is very captivating.  The lighting and the colors all work very well and create the illusion of the creature actually being in that place.  But I have some issues with the composition.  The main tree looks like it is blocking the scene rather than being a part of it.  And the creature is also a bit odd.  I think the fact that we can still make out her legs is a bit creepy, as it puts her, um, special area right in the center of the creature''s chest.  I think merging her at or just above the bellybutton would have eliminated this issue for me.  But hey, it''s your creature :-)</td>', 'Overall, this image is very captivating.  The lighting and the colors all work very well and create the illusion of the creature actually being in that place.  But I have some issues with the composition.  The main tree looks like it is blocking the scene rather than being a part of it.  And the creature is also a bit odd.  I think the fact that we can still make out her legs is a bit creepy, as it puts her, um, special area right in the center of the creature''s chest.  I think merging her at or just above the bellybutton would have eliminated this issue for me.  But hey, it''s your creature :-)', '2010-07-21 14:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099756, 898400, 88235, '<td valign="top">Wow... Ummmm just wow!</td>', 'Wow... Ummmm just wow!', '2010-07-21 14:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099758, 898539, 96751, '<td valign="top">The look on the face of the middle guy is priceless.  Great idea, although I wish the lighting would have been made to more closely match the environment he''s in.</td>', 'The look on the face of the middle guy is priceless.  Great idea, although I wish the lighting would have been made to more closely match the environment he''s in.', '2010-07-21 14:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
