(6100251, 898597, 117474, '<td valign="top">Very good indeed. Only thing for me is that I can''t make out anything to do with the shark or aquaman. It might have been nicer had they been swimming towards us, perhaps. Or maybe just cropped tighter? <br/>Maybe it''s not about the detail though. But the concept. <br/>What''s with the red thing? It makes me think of a toreador''s red cloth with bulls. Is he shark-fighting? (I don''t know anything about aquaman so maybe that''s part of his outfit)<br/>I think the editing''s excellent. 8.</td>', 'Very good indeed. Only thing for me is that I can''t make out anything to do with the shark or aquaman. It might have been nicer had they been swimming towards us, perhaps. Or maybe just cropped tighter? Maybe it''s not about the detail though. But the concept. What''s with the red thing? It makes me think of a toreador''s red cloth with bulls. Is he shark-fighting? (I don''t know anything about aquaman so maybe that''s part of his outfit)I think the editing''s excellent. 8.', '2010-07-21 20:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
