(6101615, 897952, 43463, '<td valign="top">Very errie and a bit disturbing. The distressed look to the ''photo'' adds an element of age and something nostalgic perhaps - like the old bill poster advertising circus acts of people with odd features/anomalies. Here we have a cyclops baby - perhaps it is even one of the original greek titan children. Definitely very well done in the composition and presentation and also in the creepy chill one gets when looking at this image. An above average composition - well done.</td>', 'Very errie and a bit disturbing. The distressed look to the ''photo'' adds an element of age and something nostalgic perhaps - like the old bill poster advertising circus acts of people with odd features/anomalies. Here we have a cyclops baby - perhaps it is even one of the original greek titan children. Definitely very well done in the composition and presentation and also in the creepy chill one gets when looking at this image. An above average composition - well done.', '2010-07-22 23:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
