(6103167, 897941, 100393, '<td valign="top">So well done. An expert edit indeed. Although it''s not my favourite of the challenge, it got one of the three 10s I gave out.</td>', 'So well done. An expert edit indeed. Although it''s not my favourite of the challenge, it got one of the three 10s I gave out.', '2010-07-25 03:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6103173, 897952, 100393, '<td valign="top">Freaky subject matter but great imagination demonstrated here. I really like the look you have created for the image, the coloration and distressed effect is highly effective. I think the eye doesn''t convince as much as it might - I think the horizontal perspective might be slightly off... Or, it could just be my brain refusing to accept that it looks right, after all we are more sensitive to visualization of the human face than anything else.<br/> <br/>I gave it a 10 though - it stands out in this challenge. The coloration and feel of the image suggests <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=102278" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">clive_patric_nolan</a> to me....<br/> <br/>I hope you don''t get scored down because people are a little precious about babies, this is just a photo done for a competition after all.</td>', 'Freaky subject matter but great imagination demonstrated here. I really like the look you have created for the image, the coloration and distressed effect is highly effective. I think the eye doesn''t convince as much as it might - I think the horizontal perspective might be slightly off... Or, it could just be my brain refusing to accept that it looks right, after all we are more sensitive to visualization of the human face than anything else. I gave it a 10 though - it stands out in this challenge. The coloration and feel of the image suggests  clive_patric_nolan to me.... I hope you don''t get scored down because people are a little precious about babies, this is just a photo done for a competition after all.', '2010-07-25 04:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6103176, 898581, 100393, '<td valign="top">Huge amount of effort here, a great concept too. I really like Ll the various creatures and I like how it all makes sense in terms of story (perfect title). Given the efforts you have gone to, the flat lighting and lowish contrast is a bit of a niggle - I can think a slight vignette, a bit of diffusion in the highlights and a tad more contrast would have have made the whole scene look a little more real. I am sure you wanted to ensure that we could see all of your various creatures but I think sacrificing some clarity, especially towards the edges for the sake of making the whole scene seem more real might have been a better choice.<br/> <br/> Still a 10 from me though, and of the three 10s I gave, I think this - for flat out effort, deserves the blue.</td>', 'Huge amount of effort here, a great concept too. I really like Ll the various creatures and I like how it all makes sense in terms of story (perfect title). Given the efforts you have gone to, the flat lighting and lowish contrast is a bit of a niggle - I can think a slight vignette, a bit of diffusion in the highlights and a tad more contrast would have have made the whole scene look a little more real. I am sure you wanted to ensure that we could see all of your various creatures but I think sacrificing some clarity, especially towards the edges for the sake of making the whole scene seem more real might have been a better choice.  Still a 10 from me though, and of the three 10s I gave, I think this - for flat out effort, deserves the blue.', '2010-07-25 04:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
