(6103208, 897970, 3746, '<td valign="top">Shoehorned into this challenge I feel - not a patch on some of the other work presented here. However nice generic shot, but I take the challenge subject into my scoring system and this doesnt really work for me. Without the title, it would never be classed as a shot of a `mythical` beast. Just scraped a 4 from me.</td>', 'Shoehorned into this challenge I feel - not a patch on some of the other work presented here. However nice generic shot, but I take the challenge subject into my scoring system and this doesnt really work for me. Without the title, it would never be classed as a shot of a `mythical` beast. Just scraped a 4 from me.', '2010-07-25 08:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6103209, 898521, 3746, '<td valign="top">I initially thought `eurgh`, but I assume you are trying to simulate `night-vision ` camera with the green overlay. Not a bad effort, however I would of added a bit of noise and a vignette as that would give it a better NV camera effect.</td>', 'I initially thought `eurgh`, but I assume you are trying to simulate `night-vision ` camera with the green overlay. Not a bad effort, however I would of added a bit of noise and a vignette as that would give it a better NV camera effect.', '2010-07-25 08:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
