(6103215, 897952, 3746, '<td valign="top">Finished voting and now going through my scores and adding comments. Iinitally I gave this an 8, however on second viewing I think this is a contender for the top. Great compositing, great use of photo aging techniques and overall the feel of the image is brilliant.  Hope you dont mind, but gonna adjust your score on this one to a big fat 10!  Ribbon contender I am sure.</td>', 'Finished voting and now going through my scores and adding comments. Iinitally I gave this an 8, however on second viewing I think this is a contender for the top. Great compositing, great use of photo aging techniques and overall the feel of the image is brilliant.  Hope you dont mind, but gonna adjust your score on this one to a big fat 10!  Ribbon contender I am sure.', '2010-07-25 08:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6103216, 897901, 3746, '<td valign="top">Whilst the overall quality of the actual photo is rather mediocre, there is something about the lowish quality that really adds to this image - it makes it look less `processed`. Its actually rather good. 8</td>', 'Whilst the overall quality of the actual photo is rather mediocre, there is something about the lowish quality that really adds to this image - it makes it look less `processed`. Its actually rather good. 8', '2010-07-25 08:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6103218, 898629, 3746, '<td valign="top">Love the aging of the photo in this one, it add heaps of atmosphere to the overall image, maybe adding some noise in would of been even better? This is actually rather creepy. Nice one!!<br/> <br/>EDIT - After finishing voting I am coming back to this one. I know its a cheap effect but it reminds me of all those faked ghost images from yesteryear. Gonna update this to a 9.</td>', 'Love the aging of the photo in this one, it add heaps of atmosphere to the overall image, maybe adding some noise in would of been even better? This is actually rather creepy. Nice one!! EDIT - After finishing voting I am coming back to this one. I know its a cheap effect but it reminds me of all those faked ghost images from yesteryear. Gonna update this to a 9.', '2010-07-25 08:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
