(6105731, 898688, 83313, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get the reference to a Glen Campell song, nor do I know what kind of creature this is supposed to be, but I do really like this chaotic semi-abstract imagery.<br/> <br/>Added: Backing up a bit and looking at this in thumbnail form, I am more easily recognizing the image formed by the elements of this scene. It looks like a bird headed man. I can see  the shape of a bird head and a transformer. Horus, perhaps? The title is starting to make more sense. I''m <br/>bumping up my vote on this, but since I gave it an 8 on the first pass, there''s not much of the scale remaining.</td>', 'I don''t quite get the reference to a Glen Campell song, nor do I know what kind of creature this is supposed to be, but I do really like this chaotic semi-abstract imagery. Added: Backing up a bit and looking at this in thumbnail form, I am more easily recognizing the image formed by the elements of this scene. It looks like a bird headed man. I can see  the shape of a bird head and a transformer. Horus, perhaps? The title is starting to make more sense. I''m bumping up my vote on this, but since I gave it an 8 on the first pass, there''s not much of the scale remaining.', '2010-07-27 13:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
