(6106733, 898614, 10275, '<td valign="top">This image blows my mind.  Don''t listen to the negatives about how this is not a photo. Considering you took vegetables and made it into a dragon is just pure art. It''s brilliant, sharp, the colours are vivid and the right parts are list and others dark. It''s really well done.</td>', 'This image blows my mind.  Don''t listen to the negatives about how this is not a photo. Considering you took vegetables and made it into a dragon is just pure art. It''s brilliant, sharp, the colours are vivid and the right parts are list and others dark. It''s really well done.', '2010-07-28 04:46:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6106735, 898469, 17186, '<td valign="top">this is nicely done. I enjoy the idea and concept... <br/>the only thing that got you, I think, is the blending around the protuberances on and around the bottom of the Dragonfly''s head... <br/> <br/>that one part is the only flaw i see in an otherwise perfect image! <br/> <br/>love it! <br/> <br/></td>', 'this is nicely done. I enjoy the idea and concept... the only thing that got you, I think, is the blending around the protuberances on and around the bottom of the Dragonfly''s head...  that one part is the only flaw i see in an otherwise perfect image!  love it!  ', '2010-07-28 04:58:31.000000', NULL, 0),
